### Health
GET http://localhost:4000/api/health

### Check whether check-in is open
GET http://localhost:4000/api/check-in/session

### Register and check in (only works during the Monday 7–9 PM window)
POST http://localhost:4000/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "full_name": "Jane Doe",
  "email": "jane@example.com",
  "phone_number": "+2348012345678",
  "password": "a-long-password"
}

### Sign in
POST http://localhost:4000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "login": "+2348012345678",
  "password": "a-long-password"
}

### Replace TOKEN with the token from login/register
GET http://localhost:4000/api/home
Authorization: Bearer TOKEN

### Check in
POST http://localhost:4000/api/attendance/check-in
Authorization: Bearer TOKEN
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### Attendance history
GET http://localhost:4000/api/attendance
Authorization: Bearer TOKEN

### Quotations
GET http://localhost:4000/api/quotations
